{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3746560/extras/ezgif.com-animated-gif-maker_2.gif?t=1767191513\" /></span><strong><br><br>Welcome to Ethernia</strong>, a free 2D MMORPG with pixel art, real-time combat, gathering, crafting, and an engaging narrative inspired by an ancient lost book.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83c\udf0d Open World Full of Secrets</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore unique regions, face legendary creatures, and unlock ancient powers while interacting with other players in real time.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83e\uddd9\u200d\u2640\ufe0f <strong>Choose Your Journey</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create your character, customize attributes and specializations, participate in PvE and PvP events, gather resources, and evolve your build.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udcdc <strong>Quests, Exploration, and Progression System</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From the very first steps, you'll be part of a living story\u2014filled with quests, daily challenges, bosses, and decisions that shape your path.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u2728 <strong>Highlights:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fantasy pixel art MMORPG</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >PvE, PvP, and class-based progression</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gathering, mining, and crafting system</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Active combat with skills and strategies</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deep narrative with multiple branches</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Completely free to play</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Prepare to immerse yourself in our universe, where each player is a living page of history and discover if you are the Heir of Ethernia.</i><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3746560/extras/ezgif.com-animated-gif-maker_3.gif?t=1767191513\" /></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3746560?t=1767191513","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3746560?t=1767191513","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3746560/a7a367c2a8acb514249d63821f09f39bb266e5b4/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1767191513","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3746560/a7a367c2a8acb514249d63821f09f39bb266e5b4/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1767191513","categories":[{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"MMO","id":20},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Cross-Platform Multiplayer","id":27},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"In-App Purchases","id":35},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Color Alternatives","id":66},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3746560/extras/ezgif.com-animated-gif-maker_2.gif?t=1767191513\" /></span><strong><br><br>Welcome to Ethernia</strong>, a free 2D MMORPG with pixel art, real-time combat, gathering, crafting, and an engaging narrative inspired by an ancient lost book.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83c\udf0d Open World Full of Secrets</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore unique regions, face legendary creatures, and unlock ancient powers while interacting with other players in real time.</p><h2